flowchart LR
    A[Tick start] --> B[Build<br/>spatial grid]
    B --> C[Compute<br/>sensor inputs]
    C --> D[Run predator and prey<br/>inference]
    D --> E[Update energy, age,<br/>and vitals]
    E --> F[Apply<br/>movement]
    F --> G[Resolve food and<br/>combat interactions]
    G --> H[Select reproduction<br/>candidates]
    H --> I[Crossover, mutate,<br/>and compile offspring]
    I --> J[Advance counters<br/>and finish tick]
